    <string name="welcome_brand_freedom">Music, without the strings.</string>
    <string name="welcome_brand_quiet_description">An open-source player for a world of music.\nYours to explore. Yours to make your own.</string>
    <string name="welcome_donate_quiet_title">Keep music free.</string>
    <string name="welcome_donate_letter">Spotube is built by people, not a subscription business. If it becomes part of your everyday life, a little support helps us give it the care it deserves.\n\nThank you for making room for independent software.</string>
    <string name="welcome_plugins_setup_guide">Start with a catalog plugin to find songs and playlists. Choose an audio plugin to play them. Lyrics and listening history are optional. Discover a plugin below, review its permissions, install it, then select it here.</string>
